  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 602.03 Attachments for Dam Removal Projects",
  "priorExpiration": "1990-11-07",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 602.03 Attachments for Dam Removal Projects. The following information shall be provided as an attachment to the form required in Env-Wr 602.02(b):\n\n(a) A description of the proposed methods to remove the dam, including construction sequence, so as to meet the criteria of Env-Wr 602.01 and Env-Wr 604.01(a);\n\n(b) An explanation of the purpose for removing the dam;\n\n(c) Plans showing removal design and restoration of site, including existing conditions, plan view, and a cross section of dam to be removed;\n\n(d) Description of method and location of disposal of dam materials;\n\n(e) USGS topographic map with property lines indicated;\n\n(f) Tax map showing property lines and the abutters' properties labeled;\n\n(g) Original, dated photos mounted or digital copies on 8.5\" x 11\" sheets of paper clearly illustrating the project impact area with locations of photographs noted on the plans, required in (c) above; and\n\n(h) Plans depicting the information required in Env-Wr 602.01(a).\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
}
